uick thing to mention is that griez  is another mulligan soldier  who works at the same restaurant with  nicolo he's the one that told the jagers  to come  as it's implied that elena gave him some  way of contacting them if necessary  when the survey court arrived earlier in  the episode that's when grize must have  sent the signal  and from then on it was only a matter of  time before the yagaris arrived  with that said that was my breakdown for  episode 13 of attack on titan season 4.  as usual i'd appreciate if you dropped a  like if you liked the video and let me  know in the comments what you thought of  the episode  until the next one peace out

